=====Usage notes=====
* In a [[passive voice|passive-voice]] sentence, {{m-self|zh|被}} is placed after the subject and before the doer of the action. The doer of the action is placed before the verb or can be omitted.
* As a [[neologism]], by affixing {{m-self|zh|被}} to a verb or verb phrase that is rarely used in the passive sense (e.g. an [[intransitive]] verb), a deliberate awkwardness is constructed to call to the absurdity of the situation being referred to.

